{"words": [{"text": "إِن", "translation": "Not"}, {"text": "يَدْعُونَ", "translation": "they invoke"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "دُونِهِۦٓ", "translation": "besides Him"}, {"text": "إِلَّآ", "translation": "but"}, {"text": "إِنَـٰثًۭا", "translation": "female (deities)"}, {"text": "وَإِن", "translation": "and not"}, {"text": "يَدْعُونَ", "translation": "they invoke"}, {"text": "إِلَّا", "translation": "except"}, {"text": "شَيْطَـٰنًۭا", "translation": "Shaitaan "}, {"text": "مَّرِيدًۭا", "translation": "rebellious"}], "sahih": "They call upon instead of Him none but female [deities], and they [actually] call upon none but a rebellious Satan,"}